§3  the sentence this unit set out to test
  Theseus, unit-512 §4: "A `null` is at least detectable; this is not."
  Of 25 applications of this label's patterns, a null is NOT detectable at 7
  (4 of them LIVE, i.e. reachable by a rename of the live gate's label).
  So the alternation survivor is not the only silent site — it is the only one found by eye.
